Subject: CPMS I02B Direction-Aware Generation Activation Justification

@ [justification_uuid] f8edb99c-b9f8-45cb-83f3-c5f6df0bd05b

& [Selected] is fresh-root generation plus explicit same-direction merge
  + avoids cumulative unrelated definitions
  + detects name collisions rather than accepting order suffixes
  + preserves root-specific closure and later self-contained materialization

& [RejectedOneGenerator] makes later roots depend on prior accumulation order
& [RejectedCrossDirectionMerge] confuses Deserialize and Serialize identities
& [RejectedDocumentsNow] combines primitive correctness with release artifacts and goldens
& [RejectedNewHashDependency] duplicates the existing pure core primitive

